        "title_top": "",
        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>U-POL Raptor is designed as a tough <strong>2K urethane protective coating</strong> for truck beds, metal, aluminum, fiberglass, concrete, wood, and many OEM finishes. Its biggest advantage is customization: the tintable base can be colored before application, while the coating itself is waterproof, flexible, abrasion-resistant, and designed to protect surfaces from rust, corrosion, salt, moisture, and temperature extremes. Application is relatively straightforward for a professional-style coating system: mix the liner base and Raptor hardener at the specified <strong>3:1 ratio</strong>, shake, attach the bottle to a compatible application gun, and spray. This kit includes an adjustable Custom Coat spray gun with regulator and gauge. U-POL recommends properly preparing the surface and spraying a test panel first; its technical guide specifies roughly <strong>40–60 PSI</strong> depending on the desired texture. </p><h3></h3>",
        "body_align": "center",
        "content_width": "narrow",
        "align-heading": "center",
